# dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Workspace-root lockfiles should never exist — the root package.json declares
# no dependencies (it's just a scripts wrapper). A stray lockfile here tricks
# Next.js's workspace-root auto-detection into emitting .next/standalone/ to
# the wrong tree and breaks the VPS deploy. The only real lockfile lives at
# portfolio/bun.lock. Ignore accidental root /bun.lock, and keep ignoring
# /package-lock.json so a stale npm lock cannot reappear at the workspace root.
/package-lock.json
/bun.lock
